---
title:    "Adding Constraint Handling Rules to Curry"
citation: "(WLP 2006)"
url:      "http://www.informatik.uni-kiel.de/~mh/papers/WLP06.html"
date:     2006-01-01 # used for sorting, most recent first, should usually match the papers date
---
This paper proposes an integration of Constraint Handling Rules (CHR),
a rule-based language to specify application-oriented constraint solvers, into Curry.
This integration provides a convenient way to specify
and use flexible constraint systems in applications implemented in Curry.
A revised implementation is available as a
[Curry package](https://cpm.curry-lang.org/pkgs/chr-curry.html).